@startuml

left to right direction

' Akteure
actor "System" as System

' Use Cases
rectangle "Keycloak-Integration" {
  usecase "RepLocker-App-Realm-Initialisierung" as UC1
  usecase "Singleton-Admin-Initialisierung" as UC2

  usecase "Realm automatisch erstellen" as A1
  usecase "Realm-Konfiguration setzen" as A2
  usecase "Admin-Client konfigurieren" as A3
  usecase "Realm-Keys generieren" as A4

  usecase "Admin-Benutzer anlegen" as B1
  usecase "Admin-Rollen zuweisen" as B2
  usecase "Credentials konfigurieren" as B3
  usecase "Sicherheitsmaßnahmen aktivieren" as B4
}

' Beziehungen
System --> UC1
System --> UC2
UC1 --> A1 : includes
UC1 --> A2 : includes
UC1 --> A3 : includes
UC1 --> A4 : includes
UC2 --> B1 : includes
UC2 --> B2 : includes
UC2 --> B3 : includes
UC2 --> B4 : includes

' Notizen
note right of UC1
  **Automatisierte Realm-Erstellung:**
  - Nutzt Keycloak REST-API/CLI
  - Erstellt Realm "replocker-app"
  - Konfiguriert Clients/Identity Provider
  - Synchronisiert mit Master-Realm
end note

note left of UC2
  **Admin-Setup:**
  - Einmalige Initialisierung
  - Nutzt KC_BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_* Envvars
  - Zwei-Faktor-Auth optional
  - Master-Realm nur für Setup
end note

note bottom of A1
  **Methoden:**
  1. Keycloak-Admin-API (POST /realms)
  2. Init-Skript mit realm.json
  3. Docker-Entrypoint-Erweiterung
end note

note right of B3
  **Sicherheit:**
  - Passwort-Rotation erzwingen
  - Session-Timeout: 1h
  - Failed-Login-Lockout: 5 Versuche
end note

@enduml
